    "body": "### Checklist\n\n- [x] I have searched the [existing issues](https://github.com/streamlit/streamlit/issues) for similar issues.\n- [x] I added a very descriptive title to this issue.\n- [x] I have provided sufficient information below to help reproduce this issue.\n\n### Summary\n\nFairly regularly, in production we see the following error rendered instead of several streamlit components:\n\n**TypeError**: Failed to fetch dynamically imported module: https://<webappurl>/static/js/index.B2Xocyf.js\n\nThe value after `static/js/index.` varies, we've also seen `CbuYSrVP.js`.\n\nUnfortunately, we have not been able to reproduce the problem. Is this possibly an issue with either deploying a new version of our app, or specifically deploying a new version of our app with an updated version of streamlit?\n\n### Reproducible Code Example\n\n```Python\n\n```\n\n### Steps To Reproduce\n\n_No response_\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\n_No response_\n\n### Current Behavior\n\n_No response_\n\n### Is this a regression?\n\n- [ ] Yes, this used to work in a previous version.\n\n### Debug info\n\n- Streamlit version: 1.42.2\n- Python version: 3.12.4\n- Operating System: Linux container\n- Browser: Edge/Chrome\n\n\n### Additional Information\n\n_No response_",
